!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: LNCaP
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = LNCaP cells were infected with the pooled lentiviral GeCKO v2 library at an MOI of 0.5. After three days of puromycin selection, half of the surviving cells were stored as 0 day control samples, and the rest of cells were cultured for an additional 2 weeks.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = LNCaP cells were cultured in RPMI 1640 medium supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS).
